WEBVTT

14:01.450 --> 14:03.035
Ow.

14:04.787 --> 14:08.999
Yes. Seeing a dragon
would make me very happy.

14:09.125 --> 14:11.127
Well, after 15 years
in a pleasure house,

14:11.252 --> 14:13.838
I imagine just seeing the sky
makes you happy.

14:13.963 --> 14:16.757
I was not locked in.
I have seen things.

14:16.882 --> 14:18.551
- What have you seen?
- I've seen...

14:18.676 --> 14:22.555
a man from Asshai
with a dagger of real dragonglass.

14:22.680 --> 14:24.557
- Ooh.
- I've seen a man who could

14:24.682 --> 14:29.395
change his face the way
that other men change their clothes.

14:29.520 --> 14:33.107
And I've seen a pirate
who wore his weight in gold
